I recently enjoyed an insane night of wine & food in Brooklyn, NY hosted by the one and only Wine Dr. himself. 

@dralphm_the_wine_doctor is not only the premier name in importing some of the most insane French kosher wines, he truly is so educated and knows how to educate others in regards to kosher wines. 
@dralphm_the_wine_doctor recently hosted an evening of French wines at the premier steakhouse in Brooklyn, NY. 

@chef_food_art_nyc curated an insane multi course culinary experience at @bordeauxsteakhouse where each dish was better than the next. The flavors and textures of each dish kept getting more intense and amazing as the evening went on. This was definitely a night to remember. 

Thank you Dr. Madeb for including me in this very special event and can’t wait to taste and enjoy more of your superb wine recommendations. 

@chef_food_art_nyc and the entire @bordeauxsteakhouse team, keep rocking it out and showcasing what kosher culinary cuisine should be. 

